# Heavy leaf `hs3_central_alpha`: the cleared central test `F_0` at frozen incoming norm

Along the central boundary `β = b(x, α)`, `q = q_c(x, α)`, with the incoming norm frozen at a
constant `c`: `hh3_c0_clear` (`F_0 - log(2q/r_A) = N/D`), `hh3_c_logarg` (`2q/r_A = Λ`),
`hh3_c0_h1`, `hh3_c_h2` (logarithmic derivatives of `D` and `Λ`), `hh3_c0_Q` (the cleared
α-derivative is `-P_0(x, α, c)`), `hh3_c0_P_aff` (affine in `c`) and `hh3_c0_slope_eq` (the
incoming-norm slope). Generated by `scripts/certificates/short-hand/hh3/hh3_central.py`.

## Main API

`hh3C0Ns`, `hh3C0Ds`, `hh3C0ED`, `hh3C0P`, `hh3C0S`, `hh3CLs`, `hh3CLds`, `hh3CE`, `hh3CEL`, and the identities above.

-/

